        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>2</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Check power and safety circuits first</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Simple causes are common</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>3</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Check sensor and output signals</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Locate the break in the chain</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>4</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Compare with the program logic</td>
          <td data-label="Why">See whether logic or hardware failed</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>5</strong></td>
